WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.191 --> 00:00:02.685
- I'm so scared.

00:00:02.685 --> 00:00:05.185
(rock music)

00:00:07.536 --> 00:00:08.815
- We're at Body Electric Tattoo,

00:00:08.815 --> 00:00:10.975
and I'm getting my very first tattoo.

00:00:10.975 --> 00:00:13.207
- I'm afraid of needles because
last year I got a piercing,

00:00:13.207 --> 00:00:15.426
and that piercing got stuck under my skin.

00:00:15.426 --> 00:00:17.538
- I know nothing about getting tattoos.

00:00:17.538 --> 00:00:20.326
- I'm so scared the blood
is gonna go everywhere,

00:00:20.326 --> 00:00:21.696
and it's gonna be like Sweeney Todd.

00:00:21.696 --> 00:00:22.834
This is like a Sweeney Todd chair.

00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:23.763
Do you notice that?

00:00:23.763 --> 00:00:24.866
- Today, I'm getting the pyramids.

00:00:24.866 --> 00:00:26.509
Since I'm Egyptian, I
think I need to connect

00:00:26.509 --> 00:00:27.443
to that part of me.

00:00:27.443 --> 00:00:30.565
And I'm getting "You are full
of wonder," right under it.

00:00:30.565 --> 00:00:33.115
- My writing and filmmaking
means a lot to me.

00:00:33.115 --> 00:00:35.621
And so I have "When
the world is listening,

00:00:35.621 --> 00:00:36.749
"what will you say?"

00:00:36.749 --> 00:00:40.502
- I wanna get a really simple
guitar tattoo right over here.

00:00:40.502 --> 00:00:42.269
Through my life, and especially
through my childhood,

00:00:42.269 --> 00:00:44.516
it was something that
really helped me deal with

00:00:44.516 --> 00:00:45.961
a lot of things in my life.

00:00:45.961 --> 00:00:47.278
- I hope I don't regret it.

00:00:47.278 --> 00:00:48.758
I hope this is a great idea.

00:00:48.758 --> 00:00:50.864
- I just don't want
blood to go everywhere.

00:00:50.864 --> 00:00:52.149
Is that what's gonna happen?

00:00:52.149 --> 00:00:54.566
(rock music)

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:57.449
- I don't know what's happening right now.

00:00:57.449 --> 00:00:58.282
Whoa.

00:00:59.777 --> 00:01:01.240
(plastic crackling)

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.912
Yeah, I have no idea what's going on.

00:01:02.912 --> 00:01:04.961
- So you're not just
drilling into my skin?

00:01:04.961 --> 00:01:07.200
- Well I am just drilling into your skin.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.163
- It's working.

00:01:08.163 --> 00:01:08.996
Oh.

00:01:11.265 --> 00:01:13.489
- I'm just going to lie to
my mom as long as I can.

00:01:13.489 --> 00:01:14.322
- Oh, oh.

00:01:16.523 --> 00:01:18.195
(mechanical buzzing)

00:01:18.195 --> 00:01:20.988
(exciting music)

00:01:20.988 --> 00:01:23.367
- I feel like the closer to
the boob it gets, it hurts.

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:25.503
- I was just sitting there
and I was just pondering life.

00:01:25.503 --> 00:01:27.601
- You know when you have a sharp pencil,

00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:30.057
and just someone who's just attacking you?

00:01:30.057 --> 00:01:34.406
- It kind of feels like
someone's cutting into my skin.

00:01:34.406 --> 00:01:35.797
- Oh, that hurts.

00:01:35.797 --> 00:01:36.935
- Are we done?

00:01:36.935 --> 00:01:38.818
- I held my breath for 40 minutes.

00:01:38.818 --> 00:01:39.651
- [Cameraman] No you didn't.

00:01:39.651 --> 00:01:42.388
- I feel relieved that it's done

00:01:42.388 --> 00:01:44.484
and there weren't any earthquakes.

00:01:44.484 --> 00:01:46.179
- I feel like a new person.

00:01:46.179 --> 00:01:48.574
I can't believe I just did this (laughs).

00:01:48.574 --> 00:01:49.407
- They look awesome.

00:01:49.407 --> 00:01:50.240
I love it.

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:51.682
Look.

00:01:51.682 --> 00:01:52.762
I love this.

00:01:52.762 --> 00:01:55.467
(rock music)

00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:56.300
- I'm really glad I did it,

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.037
because the outcome is so beautiful.

00:01:58.037 --> 00:01:59.966
- It definitely feels like
someone's ripping off your skin,

00:01:59.966 --> 00:02:04.418
but at the end I'm proud
that I had this experience.

00:02:04.418 --> 00:02:06.398
- I don't think the fear
of needles will go away.

00:02:06.398 --> 00:02:08.940
I think just the way you think of needles.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:12.865
- A week or so from now I'll
probably forget that it hurt,

00:02:12.865 --> 00:02:14.206
and I'll be like, yeah!

00:02:14.206 --> 00:02:15.527
Tattoos, needles, great!

00:02:15.527 --> 00:02:16.608
Let me go get a flu shot!

00:02:16.608 --> 00:02:18.470
- I think I would go get another tattoo.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.318
- Honestly, I feel much stronger.

00:02:20.318 --> 00:02:23.749
Seeing it happening made me
feel like oh, I can do anything.

00:02:23.749 --> 00:02:25.154
People say look, yeah, once you get one,

00:02:25.154 --> 00:02:26.191
you'll get addicted to it.

00:02:26.191 --> 00:02:27.024
Nah.

00:02:27.024 --> 00:02:28.720
- I hope my mom doesn't kill me.

